  "historyNote": "#7095, eff 9-15-99; ss and renumbered by #8162, eff 9-9-04 (from Sw 3001.11); ss by #8367, eff 6-2-05 ; ss by #8543, eff 1-21-06; ss by #8543, eff 1-21-06; ss by #9519, eff 7-25-09, EXPIRED: 7-25-17",
